# Route: guide 49 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 26 quests, 4.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Silithus, Thousand Needles, Swamp of Sorrows, Burning Steppes):
# Hive'Ashi -> Hive'Zora -> Twilight Base Camp -> Hive'Ashi -> Twilight Base
# Camp -> Southwind Village -> Twilight Base Camp -> Hive'Regal -> Twilight
# Base Camp -> The Crystal Vale -> Twilight Base Camp -> Southwind Village ->
# Hive'Regal -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the
# Sands (8283; Deathclasp 59); Breaking the Code (8310; Hive'Regal Ambusher
# 59-60, Hive'Regal Burrower 59-60, Hive'Regal Spitfire 59-60, Hive'Regal
# Slavemaker 59-60, Hive'Regal Hive Lord 59-61).
#
# Left out: Uniting the Shattered Amulet (3627): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 8307 Desert
# Recipe; 8313 Sharing the Knowledge; 8317 Kitchen Assistance.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770), Dark
# Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), The Heart of the Mountain
# (4123), Marshal Windsor (4241), Incendius! (4263), Put Her Down (4701), Egg
# Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735), Doomrigger's Clasp (4764), Maxwell's
# Mission (5081), General Drakkisath's Demise (5102).

